        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Story</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to graduate? Then fill up that Essence Bottle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the prestigious Haruka Girls' Academy comes a unique fox spirit girl—Hu Yingying—with her own refined sense of “Essence Aesthetics.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantity over quality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s no way for a proud fox spirit to live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Hu Yingying truly seeks is pure life essence infused with the high-level emotion called love! Using the mysterious power of the “MeowNet,” she tracks down a protagonist who has long given up on real-world romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a whirlwind of teasing and counter-teasing, trial and error, the theory-savvy fox girl gradually savors the bittersweet flavor of love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Hu Yingying succeed in absorbing the purest essence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what path will this cohabitation—filled with rising tension and blossoming feelings—lead them down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, this very moment—begin a steamy, thrilling, and just a bit beep-worthy romance with a fox spirit girl!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Character</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hu Yingying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fox spirit who’s ditched the age-old seductive charms of her kin in favor of studying human-made romance techniques, all in pursuit of the purest essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the old tales of scholars and seductresses—Yingying has her own romantic philosophy: she’ll only draw essence when her partner’s heart is truly pounding at 100%!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can’t write human language, misuses idioms left and right, carries strange leaves etched with runes, and often does blush-inducing things regardless of the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her open and honest approach to love constantly throws the awkward protagonist off guard. But if it’ll make him smile—even just a little—she’ll give it her all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally obsessed with the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her favorite thing in the world? The food he cooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchphrase: “Uguu~ Mr. Caretaker, feed me, please!”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Game Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Spine Live2D-style sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4~6 hour short romance visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Story</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to graduate? Then fill up that Essence Bottle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the prestigious Haruka Girls' Academy comes a unique fox spirit girl—Hu Yingying—with her own refined sense of “Essence Aesthetics.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantity over quality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s no way for a proud fox spirit to live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Hu Yingying truly seeks is pure life essence infused with the high-level emotion called love! Using the mysterious power of the “MeowNet,” she tracks down a protagonist who has long given up on real-world romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a whirlwind of teasing and counter-teasing, trial and error, the theory-savvy fox girl gradually savors the bittersweet flavor of love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Hu Yingying succeed in absorbing the purest essence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what path will this cohabitation—filled with rising tension and blossoming feelings—lead them down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, this very moment—begin a steamy, thrilling, and just a bit beep-worthy romance with a fox spirit girl!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Character</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hu Yingying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fox spirit who’s ditched the age-old seductive charms of her kin in favor of studying human-made romance techniques, all in pursuit of the purest essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the old tales of scholars and seductresses—Yingying has her own romantic philosophy: she’ll only draw essence when her partner’s heart is truly pounding at 100%!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can’t write human language, misuses idioms left and right, carries strange leaves etched with runes, and often does blush-inducing things regardless of the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her open and honest approach to love constantly throws the awkward protagonist off guard. But if it’ll make him smile—even just a little—she’ll give it her all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally obsessed with the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her favorite thing in the world? The food he cooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchphrase: “Uguu~ Mr. Caretaker, feed me, please!”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Game Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Spine Live2D-style sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4~6 hour short romance visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful CG illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "An uninvited fox spirit girl suddenly appears, determined to absorb the purest life essence—by having a romance that's both sultry and thrilling! And so begins a heart-pounding, sweat-inducing cohabitation life! This is a short romance visual novel guaranteed to make you smile!",
